// Isolde's Last Camp (LastCamp_1; bible 7.3 step 1). Just across the line. Her tent, her lamp still lit, her complete
// atlas. Reveal 5.2: she stole the sixth keystone from the Guild's Vault to return it to Corvin, and walked in to
// find Ilse and tell her Wren was alive. She had no tether. She believed Wren would follow and could cross.
// The pages speak in her plain voice. Reading them starts Act 3.

title: LastCamp_Isolde
---
<<if has_flag("act3.started")>>
    Pages: Every place I walked, drawn. Don't anchor what I've drawn. You know why now. #still #line:0c4e947
