<<endif>>
Pages: Journeyman. You crossed. I knew you could. I didn't know if you would. #line:07d7a31
Pages: The Vault's sixth slot. I took it. Voss let me, or didn't look. I never decided which. #reveal:5.2 #line:002d5bc
Pages: It's Corvin's stone. I'm taking it back to him. And I'm finding Ilse. #line:0a73920
Pages: Ilse should know you're alive. She'll tell you why that matters. I won't. It's hers. #line:0dc0492
Pages: No tether. I didn't want one. I thought you'd follow. Here you are. #line:08db174
Pages: The Guild will say I'm dead. They'll say it quickly. Ask yourself why so quickly. #line:02e5a8e
Pages: This is the whole atlas. Every place I walked. Take it. East is the Lantern. #line:0b55aad
-> She stole it. For him. #line:03bdfeb
